     "text": "Mike privately admitted the metal-jazz suite sounded like noise, though his bandmates still drove him to physiotherapy each Tuesday."
    },
    {
     "index": 6,
     "text": "Mike's hand regained enough strength to play straight jazz again, so he burned the metal-jazz charts in the parking lot."
    },
    {
